{"W": 993, "H": 2049, "items": [{"t": "b", "r": [0, 30, 993, 90], "c": "150,255,2", "br": 0}, {"t": "t", "r": [204, 100, 541, 30], "l": [{"x": "Dragon Boat Festival (Nulls Design)", "s": "255,255,255|23.9|400|display-extrabold|l"}]}, {"t": "t", "r": [204, 130, 40, 19], "l": [{"x": "端午節", "s": "255,255,255|13|700|display-extrabold|l"}]}, {"t": "t", "r": [204, 167, 419, 51], "l": [{"x": "Creative / 2021 / Nulls Design / Role Concept、Motion、Compositing", "s": "255,255,255|18|400|display|l"}]}, {"t": "t", "r": [204, 230, 326, 154], "l": [{"x": "在端午節，競爭是主要活動，以兩艘船互相競爭的方式，爭奪美味的粽子。最終的結果是不分上下，營造一種不分勝負的氛圍。場景方面，我們選擇使用一些典型的端午節元素，以使整個場景更具節日氛圍。", "s": "255,255,255|18|400|display|l"}]}, {"t": "t", "r": [204, 286, 326, 121], "l": [{"x": "The Dragon Boat Festival primarily revolves around competition, and we have chosen to illustrate this by depicting two boats competing to seize zongzi. Ultimately, there is no clear winner, creating a sense of equality. The scene is designed to be festive, incorporating some common elements of the Dragon Boat Festival.", "s": "255,255,255|14|400|display|l"}]}, {"t": "t", "r": [204, 416, 132, 32], "l": [{"x": "VIDEO", "s": "255,255,255|25.1|400|display-bold|l"}]}, {"t": "p", "r": [0, 456, 993, 690]}, {"t": "t", "r": [199, 1154, 132, 32], "l": [{"x": "Previz", "s": "255,255,255|25.1|400|display-bold|l"}]}, {"t": "i", "r": [199, 1194, 596, 249], "u": "55cfbad986c4406bbfe81bdc16c54fb2f000.jpg", "o": [1600, 1200]}, {"t": "i", "r": [199, 1194, 596, 249], "u": "55cfbad986c4406bbfe81bdc16c54fb2f000.jpg", "o": [1600, 1200]}, {"t": "i", "r": [199, 1443, 298, 182], "u": "b6d736600869488ca0e962191c905eddf000.jpg", "o": [1600, 1200]}, {"t": "i", "r": [497, 1443, 298, 182], "u": "3d9a3ae0c1a3428ea6f8a0f2cc041b28f000.jpg", "o": [1600, 1200]}, {"t": "t", "r": [279, 1676, 436, 189], "l": [{"x": "SUPERVISOR：徐光慧 Sylvia Hsu", "s": "255,255,255|15|400|text|l"}, {"x": "ART DIRECTOR：張雅涵 Angel Chang"}, {"x": "PRODUCER：董建潁 Jhin Dong"}, {"x": "CONCEPT & SCRIPT：廖浩辰 Hao-Chen 